b('Ex 5.5 Q6: differentiate (x + 1/x)^x + x^(1 + 1/x).', N('(x + 1/x)^x [ (x² − 1)/(x² + 1) + log(x + 1/x) ] + x^(1 + 1/x) [ (x + 1 − log x)/x² ]'))
