b('Ex 5.5 Q10: differentiate x^(x cos x) + (x² + 1)/(x² − 1).', N('x^(x cos x)[cos x (1 + log x) − x sin x log x] − 4x/(x² − 1)²'))
b('Ex 5.5 Q11: differentiate (x cos x)^x + (x sin x)^(1/x).', N('(x cos x)^x [1 − x tan x + log(x cos x)] + (x sin x)^(1/x) [ (x cot x + 1 − log(x sin x))/x² ]'))
b('Ex 5.5 Q12: dy/dx if x^y + y^x = 1.', 'Differentiate x^y and y^x by logs: ' + N('dy/dx = −(y x^(y−1) + y^x log y)/(x^y log x + x y^(x−1))'))
