b('Ex 5.7 Q13: y = 3 cos(log x) + 4 sin(log x). Show x²y₂ + xy₁ + y = 0.', 'xy₁ = −3 sin(log x) + 4 cos(log x); differentiate: x y₂ + y₁ = −3 cos(log x)/x − 4 sin(log x)/x = −y/x. Multiply by x: ' + E('x²y₂ + xy₁ + y = 0 ✓'))
